WEBVTT

00:00:14.821 --> 00:00:16.571
I brought you an umbrella.

00:00:20.438 --> 00:00:21.503
Ah, thank you.

00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:23.288
What are you doing out here?

00:00:23.788 --> 00:00:27.177
Remember when you said that I liked Lucy?

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.043
Well, it turns out,

00:00:31.921 --> 00:00:32.964
you're right.

00:00:33.756 --> 00:00:34.757
Really?

00:00:34.876 --> 00:00:36.426
Yes, but...

00:00:36.955 --> 00:00:38.776
Well, she's moving away.

00:00:39.481 --> 00:00:42.474
I'm never going to see her again.

00:00:46.204 --> 00:00:47.741
Is there anything I could do to help?

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.692
Aw, I don't... I don't think so,
sweetheart.

00:00:53.485 --> 00:00:55.387
Well, is there anything you could do?

00:00:57.709 --> 00:00:59.465
Hello, Lucy. This is Gru.

00:01:00.268 --> 00:01:03.125
I know up to this point our relationship

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:05.159
has been strictly professional,

00:01:06.072 --> 00:01:09.322
and you're leaving for Australia and all,
but...

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.725
Okay, here is the question.

00:01:13.643 --> 00:01:15.465
Would you like to...

00:01:16.725 --> 00:01:18.341
To go out on a date?

00:01:20.643 --> 00:01:21.800
Uh, no.

00:01:22.635 --> 00:01:23.794
Okay, that's not helping.

00:01:24.699 --> 00:01:26.932
All right, here we go. For real this time.

00:01:36.069 --> 00:01:37.153
(EXHALES)

00:01:37.519 --> 00:01:38.947
I can do this.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.883
Agh! I hate you!

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.366
Ah.

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.098
(FIRE ALARM RINGING)

00:02:07.976 --> 00:02:10.311
(BOTH YELLING)

00:02:11.187 --> 00:02:12.647
(IMITATING SIREN)

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.315
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:17.944
(FALLING AND SCREAMING)

00:02:19.571 --> 00:02:21.573
(YELLING)

00:02:23.157 --> 00:02:24.200
(IMITATING SIREN)

00:02:59.235 --> 00:03:00.278
Eh.

00:03:01.384 --> 00:03:02.582
-Kevin?
-Mmm?

00:03:03.307 --> 00:03:04.474
Tom?

00:03:04.507 --> 00:03:05.783
Hello!

00:03:05.912 --> 00:03:07.142
-Kampai!
-Kampai!

00:03:07.276 --> 00:03:09.329
Huh? Kampai!

00:03:12.415 --> 00:03:13.625
(EXCLAIMS FEARFULLY)

00:03:20.899 --> 00:03:21.932
Bah!

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:23.926
(LAUGHING)

00:03:26.386 --> 00:03:27.517
Oh.

00:03:29.379 --> 00:03:32.844
♪ Cinco de May-ya-yo!
Cinco de May-ya-yo! ♪

00:03:41.643 --> 00:03:42.904
EDITH: Whoa!

00:03:43.107 --> 00:03:45.156
This place is awesome!

00:03:47.533 --> 00:03:49.285
Okay. Let's party, huh?

00:03:49.494 --> 00:03:52.378
But first, let's go over the rules.

00:03:52.587 --> 00:03:55.328
Because what is fun without the rules?

00:03:55.412 --> 00:03:57.335
Agnes, easy on the churros.

00:03:57.732 --> 00:03:59.921
-Edith, try not to kill anyone.
-Hai!

00:04:00.124 --> 00:04:01.137
Margo!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.298
Hello, Mr. Gru.

00:04:02.363 --> 00:04:05.426
-(GROWLS) Okay.
- Gru!

00:04:05.693 --> 00:04:10.013
There must be the standard
six feet of space between you and boys.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.130
Especially this boy.

00:04:12.263 --> 00:04:13.755
-(GASPS)
-(LAUGHS)

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.136
Ah, you are a funny man.

00:04:15.645 --> 00:04:18.356
There are no rules, señor.
It's Cinco de Mayo.

00:04:18.564 --> 00:04:20.328
Come on! They're starting the dance!

00:04:20.583 --> 00:04:22.360
¡Arriba!

00:04:49.137 --> 00:04:50.179
(GRUNTS)

00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:23.020
(CHUCKLES) So glad you could
make it, mi compadre.

00:05:24.547 --> 00:05:25.588
Hey, what's wrong?

00:05:25.652 --> 00:05:27.684
Oh, nothing. Nothing is wrong.

00:05:27.999 --> 00:05:32.090
I'm just chilling with the guac,
from my chip hat.

00:05:35.641 --> 00:05:38.571
Gru, please. I know
that look all too well.

00:05:39.287 --> 00:05:40.839
It is the look of a broken heart.

00:05:41.814 --> 00:05:42.974
How did you know?

00:05:43.107 --> 00:05:46.316
Believe me, my friend,
I too have spent many nights

00:05:46.819 --> 00:05:50.096
trying to drown my sorrows in guacamole.

00:05:50.823 --> 00:05:52.909
-You?
-Yes.

00:05:53.756 --> 00:05:55.934
But we are survivors.

00:05:56.829 --> 00:05:59.918
There's much more to us
than meets the eye.

00:06:01.671 --> 00:06:03.079
Enjoy the party.

